Infinite - Third-Party Notices
===============================

This file lists third-party components bundled with Infinite beyond what
`LICENSE` already covers (the Steinberg VST3 SDK and, on Windows, ONNX
Runtime / DirectML / u2netp.onnx - see `LICENSE` and
`assets/models/NOTICE.txt`). It will grow; this is the first entry, added
alongside Linux Phase 3 (video/recorder/camera).

